# SCAI source data — deliberately NOT in this repository.
# These are Qatari government economic exports plus the internal QC feedback
# workbook; this repo is public. The CSVs reach the VM by rsync (README §4a
# step 0) and are bind-mounted into the etl container at load time, so nothing
# here depends on them being committed.
data/

